			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[The Death's Head are the high priests of the {link:quilboar}quilboar{/link}, keepers of the burial grounds of {link:razorfen-downs}Razorfen Downs{/link}. They have turned to the {link:scourge}Scourge{/link}. Under the lich {link:amnennar-the-coldbringer}Amnennar the Coldbringer{/link}, they serve undeath in the holiest place of their people, and many of their warriors now walk as withered corpses.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "The Bargain",
			text = [=[No one outside {link:razorfen-downs}the Downs{/link} knows the whole truth of how it began. The {link:scourge}Scourge{/link} sent an envoy, {link:ambassador-malcin}Ambassador Malcin{/link}, who offered the {link:quilboar}quilboar{/link} the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link} and more in return for their help. {link:varimathras}Varimathras{/link} believes the crone of {link:razorfen-kraul}Razorfen Kraul{/link} held herself apart from the deal. The priests of the Downs did not. Some of their tribe have grown frighteningly strong and show the marks of the plague. The {link:night-elves}night elf{/link} {link:myriam-moonsinger}Myriam Moonsinger{/link} saw quilboar creep from the shadows each day to beg the envoy for more power.]=],
